flowchart TD
    subgraph Live["Live application · Python and SQLite"]
        UI["Chess UI · Learning and Repeating"]
        UC["UI controller"]
        DB["SQLite · Real player data"]
        MC["ML controller"]
        ME["ML engine · FSRS and review planner"]
        UI -->|Start session or submit move| UC
        UC -.->|Board state, move feedback, or review availability| UI
        UC -->|Load opening lines or save practice results| DB
        DB -.->|Line data or write confirmation| UC
        UC -->|Request next review line| MC
        MC -.->|Selected line ID or no line available| UC
        MC -->|Read player data or save suggestion| DB
        DB -.->|Player data or write confirmation| MC
        MC -->|Request suggestion with player data| ME
        ME -.->|Selected line ID or no line due| MC
    end
    subgraph Offline["Offline training"]
        SC["Synthetic clients"] -->|Generate simulated practice| CSV["Synthetic practice history CSV"]
        CSV -->|Supply training data| TS["Python training script"]
        TS -->|Save model| MODEL["Trained general model"]
    end
    MODEL -->|Supply trained model| ME
